== the factorization theorem ==
  k = 6 exhaustion (Z_6): raw 44100 -> F1 282 -> F2 72 -> F3 72 -> F4 0
  ZERO three-generation survivors at k = 3 and k = 6, at every
  code tested - and this is a THEOREM, not an accident:
  replicating a base spectrum 3x multiplies every anomaly sum by
  3, so F4-spectra pass F1 iff their BASE passes F1; F2 likewise.
  By Paper 14's exhaustion theorem no base below size 3 is
  anomaly-free and chiral.  COROLLARY (minimal generation
  structure): the minimal three-generation chiral record matter
  content is 9 + 9 Weyl entries - base size 3, replicated.
  (The SM's base is 15 >= 3, replicated 3x: consistent.)

